# Build context is the repository root (api/Dockerfile, app/Dockerfile).
# Keep secrets, VCS data and local artifacts out of every image layer.
.git
.github
.claude
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
infra/secrets
infra/softhsm/tokens
infra/certs
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-native
**/build
**/.expo
**/coverage
app/android
app/ios
api/src/generated
docs
*.md
!README.md
*.log
*.sarif
